ts of the city. A giant fish that can be harvested for fillets but regenerates every night. A system of schools libraries and Hospitals with spirits dedicated to teaching new generations.<br /> <br /> <br /> Sky\u2019s the limit. It depends how much you want to spend time on appeasing the city. Would they prefer the taxes from slaves or would they like free indoor plumbing? Or a donated Armory of professionally crafted weapons and Armor and a giant bronze guardian that never sleeps and always guards the gates. Or just building a couple layers to the city state professionally created underground?</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow. Can I post this in the sorcerous workings thread?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-14T05:13:08-08:00","id":1267262,"title":"","content":"By all means!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-20T02:38:59-08:00","id":1269158,"title":"","content":"Wrong thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4588,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4588-ludek","user":"Ludek","date":". 11-20-2018, 06:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4588-ludek","name":"Ludek","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","ran